              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Knights have a hand weapon, shield and partial plate armour. May have double handed weapon (+3) and full plate armour (+1). May be Veteran (+1), and Stubborn (+3). May be Riding Horses (+1).

