              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="M" typeId="35a2-714d-db3e-3738">8</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="WS" typeId="bb04-2b70-ae79-3559">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="BS" typeId="ffff-54f0-d131-b6a9">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="S" typeId="9e7c-6fc0-c50c-ee53">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="T" typeId="d226-f704-80f9-6e23">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="W" typeId="ce59-af10-7f37-4238">1</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="I" typeId="8ec4-e9a6-0b8a-08aa">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="A" typeId="ee87-e286-4768-82be">1</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="b6d1-0987-3a4d-d6a9">8</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="05df-d816-4ba3-5153" name="Equipment and options (as printed in AoA2)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Gascons &amp; False French

All Gascons and False French are Unreliable, unless joined by an English character

Knights have hand weapon, partial plate armour, lance and shield. Shock Cavalry. First Charge. Warband rules#1 and 3. May be mounted on a warhorse (+7) that may have cloth barding (+3).

Brigans have hand weapon, buckler and light armour. They may have thrusting spear (+2), halberd (+2) or may exchange buckler for a light crossbow (+2). Skirmishers if equipped with light crossbows, Open Order if not.

If no Gascons or False French has been taken, the English may take allies from the Low Countries list.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="58d3-cd43-724f-e7e3" name="Allies and Mercenaries (Unreliable)" hidden="false" targetId="6e8f-14cf-a018-5d1c" type="rule"/>
